# The one node that grants nothing on its own. What it pays is a multiplier on
# Maple Warrior -- GMS's "increases stat bonuses as Maple Warrior by 400%",
# where the hundred at the bottom of that number is the identity and not a
# gain, so 15% of pure stat becomes 60% rather than 75%. The share here is
# what is added to that hundred: 10% a level, 300% at master.
#
# GMS bars a character without Maple Warrior from casting it. Nothing has to
# check: four times nothing is nothing, and every book in the game carries
# Maple Warrior anyway.
#
# Damage is GMS's 5 + floor(x/2)%, which ends on 20%. Held to that and given a
# clean half a point a level, so only where it starts moves -- the same trade
# Decent Holy Symbol makes.
name: "Maple World Goddess's Blessing"
description:
  "The Maple World Goddess's Blessing increases all stats and damage. Can "
  "only be used when you have Maple Warrior."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_COMMON skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_COMMON
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 60.0
  base {
    ap_stat_bonus_pct: 0.10
    damage_pct: 0.055
  }
  per_level {
    ap_stat_bonus_pct: 0.10
    damage_pct: 0.005
  }
}
